// HZM Coop Mod - suppress the vestigial MP weapon-selection menu.
//
// In coop the player's loadout is fixed and given by script
// (coop_mod/main.scr -> skipTeamAndWeaponSelect / forceTeam:
//  primarydmweapon "rifle"; pickweapon). The engine still pushes the
// MP weapon picker on connect/spawn whenever client->pers.dm_primary
// is momentarily empty (see openmohaa fgame/player.cpp UserSelectWeapon
// -> stufftext "pushmenu_weaponselect" -> client cmd "pushmenu SelectPrimaryWeapon").
//
// This mod pak (zzzzzz_co-op_hzm_mod_mohaa.pk3) loads last, and all
// ui/*.urc are loaded at UI init (client/cl_ui.cpp), so this redefinition
// of the "SelectPrimaryWeapon" menu wins over the base-game one.
//
// The override is an empty, transparent, non-fullscreen menu so the MP
// weapon picker has no visible content. It only hides the UI; the scripted
// loadout (set server-side) is unaffected.
//
// NOTE: an empty override hides the picker's *contents*, but the engine
// still pushes the menu onto the menu stack (CG_PushMenuWeaponSelect_f ->
// "pushmenu SelectPrimaryWeapon"), which turns the mouse cursor on. The
// menu must therefore be popped to clear the cursor.
//
// IMPORTANT: a "showcommand" value is NOT run as a console command. The
// engine builds Event(<value>) and ProcessEvent()s it against the widget
// (UIWidgetContainer), so it only resolves registered widget/Listener
// events. "popmenu"/"hidemenu"/"globalwidgetcommand" are console commands
// (cl_ui.cpp Cmd_AddCommand), NOT Listener events, and no widget or menu
// Listener event pops the menu stack. So "showcommand \"popmenu 0\"" can
// never work here - it just logs:
//   Event 'popmenu 0' does not exist.
//   Failed execution of event for class 'UIWidgetContainer'.
// (verified: qcommon/listener.cpp Event::FindEventNum matches the whole
//  string against the event table; PostEventInternal deletes unknown events
//  with no console-stuff fallback.)
//
// The reliable dismissal is the console command "popmenu 0" issued via
// stufftext on every (re)spawn - this is a one-line server-side hook
// documented in ui_fixes.md for coop_mod/player.scr::manageAliveSpawning.
// We therefore do NOT add a (broken) showcommand here.

// Base-MOHAA protocol pushes the generic "SelectPrimaryWeapon" menu.
menu "SelectPrimaryWeapon" 640 480 NONE 0
borderstyle NONE
bgcolor 0 0 0 0
fullscreen 0
virtualres 1
end.

// 2.0+/Spearhead/Breakthrough protocols push a per-nationality variant
// (fgame/player.cpp UserSelectWeapon). Override those too so the fix
// holds regardless of which protocol the server negotiates.
menu "SelectPrimaryWeapon_british" 640 480 NONE 0
borderstyle NONE
bgcolor 0 0 0 0
fullscreen 0
virtualres 1
end.

menu "SelectPrimaryWeapon_russian" 640 480 NONE 0
borderstyle NONE
bgcolor 0 0 0 0
fullscreen 0
virtualres 1
end.

menu "SelectPrimaryWeapon_german" 640 480 NONE 0
borderstyle NONE
bgcolor 0 0 0 0
fullscreen 0
virtualres 1
end.

menu "SelectPrimaryWeapon_italian" 640 480 NONE 0
borderstyle NONE
bgcolor 0 0 0 0
fullscreen 0
virtualres 1
end.
